  "title": "一場相見",
  "storyCode": "11-14",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-12_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "19d7dbb71bfdac2fdcf0ac2df3395b4b018e61f604a3d22c8285b8c2ea5506d1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_victoria"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "四年前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與薩卡茲相比，時間總是在你們的個體與國家身上走得很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "名為高盧的巨人倒下之後，維多利亞與萊塔尼亞瘋狂地吸收著它的遺骸。不過幾十年而已，屬於高盧的時代就已經遠去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不曾見過科西嘉一世的戰艦與火炮。你不曾感受過林貢斯的繁華與驕傲。你父輩的領地如今早已淪為維多利亞邊境貴族的轄地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你穿著維多利亞的高級軍官制服，身上掛滿了維多利亞授予的勳章。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說著標準的倫蒂尼姆貴族圈慣用的維多利亞語，甚至不帶有絲毫高盧口音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當你走到我面前，聲稱自己要與薩卡茲談判時，你憑什麼自稱“高盧人”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......攝政王殿下，如今沒有一座城市屬於那個名為高盧的國家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站在您面前的，並不是一名高盧人，而是高盧遺民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們有的身處維多利亞，有的身處哥倫比亞，有的身處萊塔尼亞。並非我們選擇流浪，而是早就沒有一個地方可被稱作故鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們想重建高盧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。就像您和其他薩卡茲想要重建卡茲戴爾一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩百年前，高盧帝國的炮兵團也曾圍在卡茲戴爾的城牆下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而此時此刻，你竟然將自己與薩卡茲相提並論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "參與那場對卡茲戴爾戰爭的也有維多利亞。而我聽說您與軍事委員會之所以能進入倫蒂尼姆，正是受到卡文迪許公爵的邀請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你也一定聽說過他的下場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十天前，斯塔福德公爵在倫蒂尼姆掀起了一場叛亂，卡文迪許公爵為阻止斯塔福德公爵的陰謀挺身而出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倫蒂尼姆城防軍參與了那場戰鬥，很遺憾，斯塔福德公爵與卡文迪許公爵都沒能從飛向彼此的炮彈下活著走出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您一定比我更清楚，其他公爵正熱切地關注著倫蒂尼姆內部的局勢。無論您之後準備在城內做什麼，您都需要新的幫手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是你與薩卡茲合作的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。如您所見，高盧遺民會全力支持卡茲戴爾軍事委員會在倫蒂尼姆的一切行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我們所希望的，只是在之後維多利亞的亂局中，讓那幾座原本屬於高盧的城市回到高盧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我答應你又如何？一個國家的興亡與其擁有的城市數量毫無瓜葛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，攝政王殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......我們已經等不到什麼更好的時機了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認識一名青年近衛軍，他曾在直屬於高盧皇帝本人的帝國衛隊服役。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認識他的時候，他已經六十多歲了。但帝國衛隊早已在四皇會戰中灰飛煙滅，所以他一輩子都成不了老近衛軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他對我說起過意氣風發的皇帝，戰無不勝的艦隊，行軍路上的笑談。幾十年來，他堅持使用高盧語一遍遍地講述這些故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他如今正躺在倫蒂尼姆切普區的一間狹小的療養院裡。我最近一次去見他的時候，他已經快忘記如何說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便如此，每天看到電視上出現帝政風格的建築時，他渾濁的眼睛還是會恢復神采，痙攣的雙手依然會忍不住抬起來鼓掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而不出五年，他就會死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後一代親眼見過高盧的高盧人正在死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攝政王殿下，您說得對。與薩卡茲相比，我們的壽命太微不足道，我們的記憶......也無法透過血脈來傳承。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等最後一代親歷者死去，我們對高盧的回憶就會和那個帝國一樣隨風而散，到了那個時候，高盧就會真正消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們唯一能做的，就是盡可能抓住這些餘燼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_g6_controltower_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弩炮發射！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "守住封閉層，別讓他們繼續靠近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城防軍士兵的鬥志很頑強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為他們的長官還在上面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些士兵......的確很尊敬那位指揮官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指揮官，薩卡茲來了！羅德島的幹員們正在與他們交戰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "支援他們。我們需要在正面戰場上盡可能地吸引敵人的注意，來為博士的行動爭取時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_g7_controltower"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海布里區的雇傭兵大概死在你的手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰爭近在眼前。你我心知肚明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿斯卡綸，你生在卡茲戴爾，長在卡茲戴爾，將軍把你從死人堆裡抱出來，殿下教你如何握緊武器保護自己、保護家園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可在這個薩卡茲最需要團結一致的時刻，你和羅德島那些薩卡茲在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你準備把我們的情報交給維多利亞人嗎？交給......一群曾經踐踏過卡茲戴爾的異族人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你背叛了你自己曾經許下的諾言，背叛了卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......卡茲戴爾距離此處有數千公里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在內戰時期，你選擇成為巴別塔的刺客，我阻止不了你，也沒有理由阻止你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為你當時效忠的是特蕾西婭殿下，薩卡茲唯一的君主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而現在呢，阿斯卡綸？你效忠的是什麼......往日的幻影嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明內戰早已結束，就連特蕾西婭殿下都已經回到了我們身邊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......四年前，是你們殺死了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，你們又用這種毫無榮耀的方式玷污了她的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真正的背叛者，是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡綸的攻擊切碎了他的法術。\n他們兩人從小就不同。\n他從將軍身上學到了許多東西，劍術、軍事理論、政治博弈的手段。而阿斯卡綸卻像她手中的武器一樣純粹。\n在戰場上，她不可能被任何言語動搖，她的眼睛裡只會裝著優先級最高的目標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊托......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這血液......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黏稠的血紅色迅速地從地面滲出來。它化身成一堵比牆更堅硬的屏障，隔開了萊托和阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_g6_controltower_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，無人機探測到又一隊薩卡茲士兵的靠近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不止是薩卡茲士兵，那湧動的紅色是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "血魔來了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "讓自救軍和普通幹員注意拉開距離。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "通知阿米婭和Logos。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就跟你想的差不多欸，他果然立刻朝著指揮塔上層去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血魔扭曲的執著確實讓那傢伙的行動軌跡很好猜啊......我不會被他影響吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "無人機的進度如何？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們也得抓緊。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好消息，這個指揮塔和城牆那邊的結構的確很近似。我已經找到了通往操控區域的最佳路徑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城防軍採用的現代化通訊手段比薩卡茲使用的通訊巫術要好利用得多。我偽裝了無人機的識別碼，來確保遠程信號不會被遮罩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......無人機本身很脆弱，萬一遭到攻擊，我們就會前功盡棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但願阿米婭他們真的能在上層把那幾個特別能打的拖住啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_g7_controltower"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弱小又愚蠢的黎博利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明知道自己的命在薩卡茲面前比絲線還易斷，竟然還不儘快逃跑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是指揮官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我的指揮塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的士兵......都還在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......或許我該考慮先把他們都清理乾淨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？這個法術，這個氣味......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......是這樣。愚蠢的替代者來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我們第一次正式見面，“魔王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經見過你許多次了，血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無數自救軍的戰士因你而犧牲。我記下了他們的名字，他們的性命絕不會因為你的輕蔑而失去應有的重量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你想怎麼做呢，“魔王”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用你的那些......漆黑的刀斧處決我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "術師小組，狙擊小組，和我一起撕開血液防線！時間有限，抓住目標！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色線條與箭矢一同沒入濃郁的血色。\n毫無變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你讓我很失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡特斯，你徒有戰士的姿態，卻不願承認殺戮對統治的必要性。你比特蕾西婭還要軟弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荒唐的特蕾西婭......她妄圖帶著薩卡茲向以維多利亞為首的侵略者們俯首稱臣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而她最為昏聵的做法，無疑是選擇了你作為繼承人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......繼續攻擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無用的掙扎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "散開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "血液組成的潮水即將捕捉到阿米婭的瞬間，突然被整齊地切開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了那位充當先鋒的刺客，你還帶著一位臣子與你同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我是阿米婭的下屬，卻並非她的附臣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女妖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫非你膽怯了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為......躲在那個名為羅德島的殼子裡，就能否認自己與這贗品的關係，躲過卡茲戴爾對叛徒的審判？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的言辭總是充滿謬誤，血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從決定前來倫蒂尼姆的那一刻起，我便已暫時脫下羅德島的精英幹員制服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是女妖之主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我於此言語，即是喪鐘的王庭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年輕的女妖抬起手。\n深色的法袍上，咒文輕柔地躍動，宛如晨曦中滾下的第一滴露珠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我追隨的並非魔王的冠冕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "令我前行至此的正是特蕾西婭殿下的理想。你們奪走且褻瀆了她的生命，卻無法熄滅她在我們眼前燃起的炬火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_650_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "見過黎明光輝之人，怎可能再度回到永夜之中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
